logs
*.log
# `npm run tauri dev` output is routinely tee'd to dev_log*.txt at the repo root. It is not a
# `.log`, so it stayed untracked-but-visible and tripped ship-reinstall's DIRTY-STAMP gate
# (2026-08-12) — the build stamped "+dirty" purely because of dev noise, which is exactly the
# false positive that makes a real dirty stamp easy to wave off.
dev_log*.txt
